/ ページヘッダー
.mb-6
  h2.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-800.dark:text-white レッスン管理
  p.text-sm.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400.mt-2 公式レッスン、自作レッスン、公開レッスンを確認・管理できます

/ 新規作成ボタン
.mb-6
  .flex.justify-end
    = link_to new_my_lesson_path, class: "px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-700 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 dark:hover:bg-blue-800 transition" do
      svg.w-5.h-5.inline-block.mr-2 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"
      | 新規作成

/ タブナビゲーション
.mb-6 data-controller="tabs"
  .border-b.border-gray-200.dark:border-gray-700
    nav.flex.space-x-2 aria-label="Tabs"
      - @tabs.each do |tab_key, tab_config|
        = link_to my_lessons_path(tab: tab_key), data: { turbo_frame: "lesson_management_content", tabs_target: "tab", tab: tab_key }, class: "group inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 border-b-2 font-medium text-sm transition-colors #{'border-blue-500 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400' if @current_tab == tab_key.to_s} #{'border-transparent text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 hover:border-gray-300 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300 dark:hover:border-gray-600' unless @current_tab == tab_key.to_s}" do
          span.text-xl = tab_config[:icon]
          = Category.tab_name(tab_key)

  / Turbo Frame for lesson management content
  = turbo_frame_tag "lesson_management_content", data: { tabs_target: "content" } do
    = render partial: "tab_content", locals: { tab_key: @current_tab }
